<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 15:38:24 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>QuEra 的量子计算机在精确频率的激光上运行，这种精度是肉眼无法看到的，只有原子才能区分</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/queras-quantum-computers-run-on-lasers-held-at-exact-frequencies-a-precision-no-eye-can-see-and-only-the-atoms-can-distinguish</link><description>保持激光存在是一个连续的行为：温度、振动和压力将其推离目标一整天，而分层反馈将其推回目标。当反馈回路出现故障时，锁就会断开，机器就会停止。历史上，将其恢复需要一位特定的专家：他对激光器有直观的了解，并且对将其恢复到正确状态所需的确切恢复顺序有经验。如果锁在半夜坏了，那个人就必须开车去实验室修理。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/queras-quantum-computers-run-on-lasers-held-at-exact-frequencies-a-precision-no-eye-can-see-and-only-the-atoms-can-distinguish.gif" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 15:38:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/queras-quantum-computers-run-on-lasers-held-at-exact-frequencies-a-precision-no-eye-can-see-and-only-the-atoms-can-distinguish</guid></item><item><title>患者样本表明，导尿管上的念珠菌可能不仅仅是污染</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/candida-on-urinary-catheters-can-be-more-than-contamination-patient-samples-suggest</link><description>依靠导尿管是每年数十万患者医疗护理的标准组成部分。不幸的是，该装置存在导管相关尿路感染 (CAUTI) 的风险，细菌被广泛认为是其主要原因。然而，许多患者面临着另一种病原体日益严重的威胁：一种真菌，白色念珠菌。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/candida-on-urinary-catheters-can-be-more-than-contamination-patient-samples-suggest.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 15:23:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/candida-on-urinary-catheters-can-be-more-than-contamination-patient-samples-suggest</guid></item><item><title>科学家发现一种可以阻止乳腺癌扩散的大麻受体</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/scientists-discover-a-cannabis-receptor-that-could-stop-breast-cancer-spreading</link><description>事实证明，癌细胞比我们想象的更棘手，因此科学家们为了让生存几率向对我们有利的方向转变变得更加棘手。最近的医学研究强调了一个重要问题：癌细胞表现出可塑性。一些癌细胞可以自发地从分化状态恢复到“不成熟”并再次变得类似干细胞，改变其身份以产生更加多样化、更具侵袭性和增殖性的肿瘤。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-discover-a-cannabis-receptor-that-could-stop-breast-cancer-spreading2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 15:08:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/scientists-discover-a-cannabis-receptor-that-could-stop-breast-cancer-spreading</guid></item><item><title>脑蛋白研究激发了对自闭症治疗的乐观态度</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/study-of-brain-proteins-spurs-optimism-for-autism-treatments</link><description>研究人员希望他们的发现能够为严重自闭症患者的未来治疗提供参考。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/study-of-brain-proteins-spurs-optimism-for-autism-treatments.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 14:53:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/study-of-brain-proteins-spurs-optimism-for-autism-treatments</guid></item><item><title>线性代数（基础和维数）</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/linear-algebra-basis-and-dimension</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 14:38:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/linear-algebra-basis-and-dimension</guid></item><item><title>行星际航天器捕获隐藏在地球之外的日冕物质抛射组件</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/interplanetary-spacecraft-capture-a-coronal-mass-ejection-component-hidden-from-earth</link><description>在日冕物质抛射（CME）过程中，太阳将数十亿吨磁化等离子体抛入太空。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/interplanetary-spacecraft-capture-a-coronal-mass-ejection-component-hidden-from-earth.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 14:23:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/interplanetary-spacecraft-capture-a-coronal-mass-ejection-component-hidden-from-earth</guid></item><item><title>为什么记忆会随着年龄的增长而变得模糊——以及什么取代了它们</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/why-memories-get-fuzzier-with-age-and-what-replaces-them</link><description>这项新研究表明，随着人们年龄的增长，他们不仅记住过去的细节越来越少，而且在不同类型的记忆之间切换时也会更加困难。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/why-memories-get-fuzzier-with-age-and-what-replaces-them.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 14:08:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/why-memories-get-fuzzier-with-age-and-what-replaces-them</guid></item><item><title>南希·格雷斯·罗马太空望远镜</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nancy-grace-roman-space-telescope</link><description>南希·格雷斯·罗马太空望远镜将解决暗能量、系外行星和天体物理学领域的基本问题。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nancy-grace-roman-space-telescope.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 13:53:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nancy-grace-roman-space-telescope</guid></item><item><title>抑郁症可能会在衰老的大脑上留下痕迹</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/depression-may-leave-a-physical-mark-on-the-aging-brain</link><description>研究人员分析了 2009 名认知健康的老年人的 MRI 扫描结果。抑郁症与海马 CA23DG 亚区体积减少有关，与淀粉样蛋白、tau 蛋白和遗传性阿尔茨海默病危险因素无关。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/depression-may-leave-a-physical-mark-on-the-aging-brain.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 13:38:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/depression-may-leave-a-physical-mark-on-the-aging-brain</guid></item><item><title>癌症干细胞生态位：其在调节肿瘤细胞干性方面有多重要？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-cancer-stem-cell-niche-how-essential-is-the-niche-in-regulating-stemness-of-tumor-cells</link><description>癌症干细胞（CSC）是具有自我更新、克隆肿瘤起始能力和克隆长期增殖潜力等主要特性的肿瘤细胞。 CSC 存在于肿瘤微环境中的生态位中，这些区域在解剖学上是不同的区域。这些生态位保持了 CSC 的主要特性，保留其表型可塑性，保护它们免受免疫系统的影响并促进其转移潜力。从这个角度来看，我们重点关注 CSC 生态位并讨论其对肿瘤发生和进展的贡献。由于 CSC 在许多常用的癌症疗法中都能存活，因此我们研究了将利基成分作为优选治疗靶点的前景。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-cancer-stem-cell-niche-how-essential-is-the-niche-in-regulating-stemness-of-tumor-cells.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 13:23:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-cancer-stem-cell-niche-how-essential-is-the-niche-in-regulating-stemness-of-tumor-cells</guid></item></channel></rss>